{"title": "Bound Weapon (Condition)", "pageid": 9720, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bound_Weapon_(Condition)", "categories": ["Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bound Weapon Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bound Weapon</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Ritually bound to its wielder.</li>\n<li>The weapon cannot be knocked out of the wielder's hand, and automatically returns to its wielder when <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WEAPON_BOND</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CWEAPON_BOND%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CWEAPON_BOND%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition lacks the <code>Attributed(InventoryBound)</code> code that is otherwise found on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bind Pact Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\">Bind Pact Weapon</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\">Bind Hexed Weapon</a>. Although this was (apparently) done to allow a bound weapon to be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a>, it also has the side effect of allowing an <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a> to give their bound weapon to any other character to use to the same effect. Thus, others can equip a bound weapon and use it as if they had bound it themselves, even if they are not an Eldritch Knight. For example, one can use an Eldritch Knight <a href=\"/wiki/Hireling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hireling\">Hireling</a> to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Bond\" title=\"Weapon Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/40px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Bond\" title=\"Weapon Bond\">Weapon Bond</a> on a weapon, give it to another character, and then remove the hireling from the active party and / or dismiss them. In this way a bound weapon can be used by any party member – until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Bound_Weapon\">Sources of Bound Weapon</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst\" title=\"Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone-Pommelled_Bloodthirst\" title=\"Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst\">Netherstone-Pommelled Bloodthirst</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Woe\" title=\"Woe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Woe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Woe\" title=\"Woe\">Woe</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Bond\" title=\"Weapon Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/45px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/60px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Weapon_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Bond\" title=\"Weapon Bond\">Weapon Bond</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195144\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46233/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14376/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.041/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1240887/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   71.622      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   71.622      1 -t